# Frontend

- Chessground is presentation only: no client-side move legality. Use `dests` and FEN from Tauri.
- App chrome (layout, buttons, modals, status): Tailwind + daisyUI class names.
- Do not override Chessground `cg-*` classes with utilities; import chessground CSS next to the board.
- Prefer thin wrappers (`ChessBoard`) over third-party React Chessground packages unless needed.
- User-facing UI copy may be Russian.
- Add JS packages with `npm install`, not by editing `package.json` by hand.
